          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What is your typical timeline?",
          "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "The timeline varies depending on the video's complexity and your specific requirements. We will provide a detailed timeline during our initial discussion, and we keep you updated throughout the production process." }
